From 29248861f58e4fa1c407c178f276acf17e4c7230 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kazhiramatsu <kazutakehiramatsu@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 00:27:36 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] draft(A6-41 item 3b): _outerThis is a file-wide optimistic
 binding; FileLevel census is the parsed one

generated_bindings.rs: allocate_planned_file_wide_optimistic = tsc
makeUniqueName(base, isUniqueName, optimistic, scoped=false): the name is
recorded in the file-wide generatedNames domain (source scope), collides with
source identifiers and every earlier file-wide generated name, and is never
reused by sibling or nested scopes.
target_bindings.rs: TargetBinding::allocate_preferred_optimistic (preferred
base, not reserved in nested scopes); the finalizer routes non-reserved
scoped-optimistic bindings to the file-wide allocation (no producer used that
combination before); ParsedSourceIdentifierNames::into_names.
standard_decorators.rs: _outerThis is such a binding (one per class, named
in print order: _outerThis, _outerThis_1, ...); the FileLevel collision set
is ParsedSourceIdentifierNames (SourceFile.identifiers) instead of the
transform arena census that includes synthetic nodes.
---
